Description: terminal UI for Keysight/Agilent DC power supplies
 Sets and reads a bench supply over RS-232, GPIB, TCP or MQTT: setpoints,
 output state, measured volts, amps and watts, ranges, OVP and the
 instrument's own fault flags.
 .
 Supports the E364xA family (E3640A to E3645A) and the 661xC family
 (6611C to 6614C), detected with *IDN?, plus a simulator with a resistive
 load for when there is no instrument to hand.
 .
 Subcommands print JSON instead of starting the UI, so the same tool can be
 driven from a script.
